# Its id leads with aspect-: a State of the same name (Raging, Mindful, God Ki) has the bare one.
id: aspect-fading
name: Fading
polarity: negative
levels: true
max: 2
# [Solo]: its levels are not added between Transformations used together - the highest of them.
solo: true
# number: its script is the whole of it. moment: entering, leaving, the start of a turn (stages 4-5).
# rule: how a Transformation is entered, left or Mastered - asked by transformations.mjs aspectLevel.
group: moment
# The rule in short, for its hovers; its own words below (the page the user gave, 2026-11-20).
summary: >
  Level 1: having left it you cannot enter it again this Encounter. Level 2: leaving it you lose access to it.
text: >
  Fading [Solo, LV~2]: This Transformation is only available for a limited time.
  –Effect: Depending on the level, apply the following effects:
  • LV1: Upon leaving this Transformation, you cannot enter this Transformation again for the remainder of the Combat Encounter.
  • LV2: Upon leaving this Transformation, you lose access to this Transformation.

---

# Nothing it does by itself yet: its stage builds it.
